\details{
\subsection{Objective and constraints}{

The objective and constraints are performance metric functions (see \link{PM},
\code{\link[=NewPM]{NewPM()}}), specified with \code{\link[=TuneObjective]{TuneObjective()}} and \code{\link[=TuneConstraint]{TuneConstraint()}}. When
